# Sidehustle project — drop into any repo under ~/sidebiz/ as `.envrc`.
# Loads Stripe + GitHub + OpenRouter under the sidebiz Bitwarden context (via
# rbw). Git identity (sidebiz email + signing key + github-sidebiz SSH alias)
# routes via ~/.gitconfig's includeIf "gitdir:~/sidebiz/" rule.
use ctx sidebiz
